\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. I the good fight have fought',
\par O when shall I declare?
\par The victory by my Saviour got
\par I long with Paul to share.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O may I triumph so,
\par When all my warfare's past,
\par And, dying, find my latest foe
\par Under my feet at last.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. This blessed word be mine
\par Just as the port is gained:
\par Kept by the power of grace divine,
\par I have the faith maintained.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The apostles of my Lord,
\par To whom it first was given,
\par They could not speak a greater word,
\par Nor all the saints in heaven.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

